      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a lot stronger. \"gatekeepers\" is a powerful word. i think the members of the society would really connect with that. do you think it's fair to say that without these protections, the community basically loses its right to define itself and just becomes whatever the newest demographic wants it to be?",
